<parameterdescription>
<para>Requested action; an undefined or non-atomic mask yields <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacexverse_1_1xcom_1_1validation_1a4d261acef1c4b2fe2545c321769d18bdabf09dc57124fee4d1ef317163db466e6" kindref="member">Result::UndefinedAction</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
